<title>USA: Fluke settles suit with Wavetek.</title>
<headline>Fluke settles suit with Wavetek.</headline>
<dateline>EVERETT, Wash. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fluke Corp and  Wavetek Corp said on Monday that they have resolved the lawsuit Fluke filed against Wavetek on September 27 in the Federal District Court in Seattle, Washington.</p>
<p>The companies said that Wavetek has agreed to stop selling and advertising dark-bodied digital multimeters (DMMs) having a yellow holster or yellow border surrounding the meter, without admitting liability.</p>
<p>The scope of the agreement is worldwide and applies to present and future DMMs sold by Wavetek, the companies said.</p>
